  storyText: "Doc Mori's Clinic\n\nA ripperdoc den behind a noodle shop. Doc Mori looks at your HUD. \"Military-grade ICE. 300 eb.\" You don't have anything close to that.\n\n\"Or,\" she says, \"Maelstrom stole a crate of my meds. Bring it back and the ICE is yours.\"\n\n1. Take the job in Northside.\n2. Grab the ICE chip and run.\n3. Leave."
